  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">FAPEP:AR-L10145 Programa de Infraestructura Vial Productiva</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PEF: AR-L1045 Productive Road Infrastructure Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The facility will provide the necessary resources required to approve the Productive Road Infrastructure Program, with the objective of complementing the road infrastructure in those provinces that have received the impact of natural phenomenons, such as &quot;El Nio&quot;, in order to improve their competitiveness. The program will add upon and complement the Emergency Program for recovery of areas affected by flooding, 1118OC-AR.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
